are controlled by a preprocessor macro, so you only have to take the
sets of changes in which you are interested.

http://www.jcatena.net/nethack/patches.shtml#jdc

jdc02a includes:
  version rse03a of my "Ranger Species Enemy/Ally" patch; and
  version mvm06a of my "Monk Void Modifier" patch, which includes a
